      "message": "+1.  If somehow bmcweb is up, but user management isn\u0027t, that\u0027s an internal error that the user can do nothing about.  There\u0027s nothing about this patch that would imply that this is a temporary condition.",
      "parentUuid": "c51cb9dc_0cb04159",
      "revId": "28c7b79eeda921415a6811e5feedcf7382ecdb4d",
